    "title": "How do we match Automatic Vehicle Location (AVL) data to schedules?",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-17T13:07:00Z",
    "description": "<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"127\">AVL data is received from the vehicles and is automatically matched to journeys in the schedules supplied to BODS. Using various fields in the SIRI-VM data including &quot;OperatorRef&quot;, &quot;LineRef&quot; and &quot;DatedVehicleJourneyRef&quot; the system will scan the schedules to find a match.</p>",
