    "title": "How do we calculate On Time Performance?",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-17T13:07:00Z",
    "description": "<ol><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3126\" dir=\"ltr\">We calculate your punctuality figures by matching your static timetable data with your AVL feeds. Please see &quot;How do we match Automatic Vehicle Location (AVL) data to schedules?&quot; for more information.</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3316\">We ONLY include where a departure is recorded.</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3415\" dir=\"ltr\">We use the OTC definitions for early and late. Please see the Late, On-Time and Early sections for more information.</li></ol>",
    "description_text": "1. We calculate your punctuality figures by matching your static timetable data with your AVL feeds. Please see \"How do we match Automatic Vehicle Location (AVL) data to schedules?\" for more information. 2. We ONLY include where a departure is recorded. 3. We use the OTC definitions for early and late. Please see the Late, On-Time and Early sections for more information.",
