    "title": "Late",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-17T13:07:00Z",
    "description": "<p data-identifyelement=\"471\" data-renderer-start-pos=\"3540\" dir=\"ltr\">We calculate late buses as per the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/traffic-commissioners-local-bus-services-in-england-outside-london-and-wales-november-2018/statutory-document-no-14-local-bus-services-in-england-outside-london-and-wales#directions\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Traffic Commissioner's guidelines</a>, which means anything over 5 minutes 59 seconds counts as late. If the bus was exactly 5m 59s late, it would count as on time, 6 minutes would count as late.</p>",
    "description_text": "We calculate late buses as per the Traffic Commissioner's guidelines, which means anything over 5 minutes 59 seconds counts as late. If the bus was exactly 5m 59s late, it would count as on time, 6 minutes would count as late.",
