    "title": "Missing Data",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-17T13:07:00Z",
    "description": "<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4066\">We don't include missing data in your on-time percentages.</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"4126\">There are a few of reasons why you might be seeing missing journeys from ABODS:</p><ol><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"4206\">The static data was not correct in BODS, so ABODS wasn't able to match AVL to the static data.</li><li  data-renderer-start-pos=\"4304\" dir=\"ltr\">We didn't receive AVL data. This could be for many reasons: the ticket machine wasn't turned on, or the ticket machine didn't have signal and was not able to upload the data once reconnected. If this continues to be a problem we suggest you speak to your AVL supplier directly. We are working hard to ensure greater completeness of AVL data on ABODS!</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"4567\">The line name in the static data and the AVL file don't match</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"4633\" dir=\"ltr\">We didn't receive enough AVL data around a stop</li></ol>",
    "description_text": "We don't include missing data in your on-time percentages. There are a few of reasons why you might be seeing missing journeys from ABODS: 1. The static data was not correct in BODS, so ABODS wasn't able to match AVL to the static data. 2. We didn't receive AVL data. This could be for many reasons: the ticket machine wasn't turned on, or the ticket machine didn't have signal and was not able to upload the data once reconnected. If this continues to be a problem we suggest you speak to your AVL supplier directly. We are working hard to ensure greater completeness of AVL data on ABODS! 3. The line name in the static data and the AVL file don't match 4. We didn't receive enough AVL data around a stop",
